<section class="brand-story brand-story-editorial" id="about">
  <div class="story-heading">
    <span class="micro">OUR STORY / EST. 2026</span>
    <h2>END THE<br>ORDINARY.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="story-body">
    <p class="story-intro">Two cousins. A shared obsession with clothes. One idea: make the pieces we'd actually want to wear.</p>
    <div class="story-rule"></div>
    <p>END CULTURE started from our own taste — the fits, fabrics and details we kept looking for ourselves. We don't put our name on something just to fill a collection. Every piece has to feel right, wear right and meet the standard we'd expect if we were buying it.</p>
    <p>That's why we work in limited drops. Fewer pieces. More consideration. Released when they're ready, not because a calendar says they should be.</p>
    <p class="story-standard">IF WE WOULDN'T WEAR IT,<br>WE DON'T RELEASE IT.</p>
    <div class="story-footerline"><span>END CULTURE®</span><span>TWO COUSINS / OUR TASTE / OUR STANDARD</span></div>
  </div>
</section>
